// Card Molecule Component
// This is a simple combination of atoms for content display
// TODO: Implement as the site is built out
// 
// Purpose: Reusable card component combining Heading, content, and Button atoms
// Usage: <Card title="Card Title" description="Card description" />
// 
// Props to implement:
// - title?: string (card title)
// - description?: string (card description)
// - image?: string (card image URL)
// - imageAlt?: string (image alt text)
// - actions?: CardAction[] (action buttons)
// - variant: 'default' | 'elevated' | 'outlined' | 'filled'
// - size: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg'
// - interactive?: boolean (clickable card)
// - loading?: boolean (loading state)
// - disabled?: boolean
// - className?: string (additional CSS classes)
// 
// Atoms used:
// - Heading (for card title)
// - Button (for card actions)
// - Icon (for card icons)
// 
// Design tokens to use:
// - Consistent border radius and shadows
// - Spacing and padding scale
// - Color variants for different states
// - Hover and focus states
// 
// Accessibility requirements:
// - Proper heading hierarchy
// - Keyboard navigation support
// - Screen reader support
// - Focus indicators
// - Image alt text
